# The git ref of huri-core this checkout of huri-modules is built and tested
# against. Shell-sourceable: KEY=value lines, no spaces around "=", comments
# allowed. A release tag ("0.4.0") on main; on dev, a tag or "dev".
# RELEASING.md says when it moves.
#
# Readers: scripts/install_local.sh (install.sh), deploy/install_huri.sh and the
# Dockerfiles' build args, the CI workflows. The environment variable of the
# same name overrides this file for the installer, as does HURI_CORE_PATH (a
# local checkout, installed editable). huri-cli, the reference client the
# installer adds, is not pinned: it is its newest release that supports this core.

# huri-core: https://github.com/Lucy-Robotics/huri-core (the framework).
HURI_CORE_REF=0.5.0
